  "question": {
    "text": "<p>If the reaction sequence given below is carried out with <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>15</mn></math>&nbsp;moles of acetylene, the amount of the product <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">D</mi></math>&nbsp;formed (in <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi></math>) is</p><p><img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_advanced/0b0d5b06-6b18-415c-9251-c010f482c304-image.png\" style=\"width: 700px; height: 88px;\" /></p><p>The yields of&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi><mo>,</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">B</mi><mo>,</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi></math> and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">D</mi></math> are given in parentheses.</p><p>[Given: Atomic mass of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>12</mn><mo>,</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>16</mn><mo>,</mo><mi>Cl</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>35</mn></math>]</p>",
    "image": null
  },
  "options": [],
  "correctValue": "136",
  "solution": {
    "text": "<blockquote><p><img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_advanced/224f6da2-8115-49fa-b971-ec9920623733-image.png\" style=\"width: 300px; height: 485px;\" /></p><p>Molecular formula of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">D</mi></math> is&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><mn>8</mn></msub><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mn>8</mn></msub><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></math></p><p>Molar mass of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">D</mi></math>&nbsp;is&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mrow><mn>12</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>8</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>8</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>16</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>136</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8756;</mo></math> Mass of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">D</mi></math>&nbsp;is&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>136</mn></math></p></blockquote>",
